ee required data points (points, team, position) were accurately extracted and verified against the screenshots. While other games on the same slate had high scorers (e.g., Edwards with 47), the singular phrasing of the task refers to the top scorer of the single latest completed game, which the agent correctly identified and documented.\n\n**Verdict: SUCCESS**",
